Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.70,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,listen white hunter i'm telling you\Nright now keep your distance from caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,last thing i need to deal with is us\Ntaking turns squeezing each other's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,i know you're filled\Nwith hellfire right now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but save it until i get\Nmy heart back from vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as we're on this island\Nyou're following my orders got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the shortest route here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was moving as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you're incessantly irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Spoke too soon there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Unflammable type.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, I'll gasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What reason do you have for attacking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than you trying to kill me\Nand my friends and everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,something cool's supposed\Nto happen if I capture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds to me like you formed\Nsome kind of alliance with Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Trusting him is an act of foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it from my own experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He will betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever I wanna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a glutton\Nfor pain, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Karakuni!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, I'm choking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people do that when\NI remove their oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you've got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My powers are locked within a set radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, how long can\Nyou stay out of that radius?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready for Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you the jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt, you dullard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, it allowed me\Nto close the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks painful. Well, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Want your oxygen back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe in the blue sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to be slashed and seared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Every gas is a weapon for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can't kill you with poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've still got an entire arsenal\Nthat'll put you in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting real tired of not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit running and give me your breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum, Jake Gottlieb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell? Igloo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't too many people alive that\Ncould actually break through this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got Devil Fruit powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to go, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a pointless fight you're\Ntelling me so what you're just
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna run do your worst Straw Hat\NI've got bigger fish to fry but I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,keep you in my thoughts when I use\Nyour crew as test subjects for my
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,experiment enjoy your demise sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't go after him I won't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,let the master suffer any further\Nmisfortune joker would kill me if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,i allowed that you mean the pink\Nbird guy from the war what the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,is up with that dude the gate's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,closing we gotta run hooray ain't that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,black-legged Sanji i don't get it\Nwhat's a Straw Hat doing helping us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Full power strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It don't look like Black\NLake's going to back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's beating the hell\Nout of that fake Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to give you some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you morons doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Start running already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to seal you\Nup in here to poison you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're letting the gas in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We better run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got metal or something\Nunder your skin, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an internal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm familiar with your type.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My captain hates guys like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Blackley!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna run, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The main's closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get trapped in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas is right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an alert from Building D!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention all buildings in the\Nthird laboratory! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is building D!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention all buildings\Nin the third laboratory!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Warlord Shavulgar Law\Nhas infiltrated the premises!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's just gained access\Nto the SAD Manufacturing Room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that fool think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If he goes through with this, he's gonna\Nbite off more than even he can chew!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That was his plan all along. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You capture the Master\Nwhile he finds S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I finally see what\Nyour little scheme is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He formed an alliance with the\NStrawhats just to keep us busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And he probably joined the Warlords\Njust so he can gain access to that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:10:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have one seriously hellish\Nscenario banging around inside his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to unleash\Nhell on the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on, don't close it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's right, that fake\Nnirgle guy in Blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't made it out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The poison gas is about\Nto be all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking good! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially you, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You survived after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You really scared us, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on kicking ass, Blackwing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.28,0:10:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a bunch of ugly\Ndudes singing my praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies only!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can give you some\Nfirst aid if you got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you can get me a kiss from\Nyour captain, then I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy could have destroyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that bastard anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Some commander of yours or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was just someone\Npretending to be the Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a good guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell him what's up, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks of the G5 as a sort of family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've never met the guy myself,\Nso I couldn't tell you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know that he turned\Npale and ran off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we should get moving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to save those children\Nand get everyone out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whatever you say, we're all on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Law's going after S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,With this development, there's\Nno doubt he's betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't say I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's some gratitude\Nafter I took him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I treated that punk like a\Nbrother, and this is what I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A pity, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it to the\Nmanufacturing room, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I'd do if I were him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd destroy everything in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd kidnap Caesar, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe just kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to my love?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him out of the way and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who can make S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, he's the only\None who even knows how.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, if Law is able to pull that off,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we've got a big problem, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To be specific, it's a problem for\Nme, because this is my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If it dries up, people will be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Baby Five, what the hell\Ndo you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky the young\Nmaster's so forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill him with my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last straw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They say misfortune never comes alone. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so my misfortune is\Ngoing to be his next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Law, that adorable little scamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master, whatever are\Nyou going to do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know darn well Law will\Nget exactly what he deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this will be difficult for you,\NVergo, but I need you to take care of Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, make it as cruel and\Ngruesome as you can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want him to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, Dolfi, I'll even take a\Npicture of this corpse for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember my camera I'm always using?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't think I've ever\Ntaken a single photo in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I'll bring you an ear instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that idea even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba-da-ba-da-ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aziza, Monet, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker, why, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be careful with Law,\Nbut Straw Hat's dangerous, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He acts stupid, but I've seen\Nhim use the Conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He might have more potential than Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby Five here is armed to the\Nteeth and itching for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:15:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send her along with Buffalo\Nto make certain things go smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When this is all over, come\Nback to Dressrosa immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon looks like a runt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's actually causing a lot\Nmore damage than the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I like his attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off my back and fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go stop that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's turned this building\Ninto a sea of flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this is bad isn't it those tanks\Nare on fire what happens if
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,one of them explodes then they\Nblow a giant hole in the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and all the poison gas from\Noutside pours in i don't care
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,how tough you are if that happens\Nevery last one of us is dead
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,look no further my friend\Nsee i have a score to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,settle with dragon guy so\Nmy fury shall be unbridled
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,by the might of this\Nsword i do swear the beast
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:16:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,shall be destroyed not so\Nfast that loathsome dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,has done me a great wrong\Nand i will reclaim my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,honor in blood and yet\Ndid you notice its cruelty
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,he charged as if to consume\Nme then he turned away
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,as if i were some bag of\Nbones Dragons need meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that\Nbones contain nutrients, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I insist that you let me\Nvanquish this dreadful dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You stand back and watch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall too! You shall not! I shall shall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nin, nin, nin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you casting a spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what samurai do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ninja, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Under trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the cheating, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Press Ben, girl, you're\Nproficient in the ninja arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me that, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a whiff of the\Nworld's smelliest flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now special attack,\NCreepstar Rafflesia! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.00,0:17:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The long-nosed goblin commits\Nfrightful sorcery as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for rent-up lure, Katorea Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all-powerful ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall do no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my lead, Sir Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will show you glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Foxfire style.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame split.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It cut fire again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work. But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for my cavat bon nevon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And flaming flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, did you just call me a corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, well, that's fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, you great dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Say the bones are delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Beauty dragon, take that and another!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a history between\Nyou and dragons, Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did one perhaps eat your family\Nor something of the sort?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Were that the case, my\Ngrudge could be no greater!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your bony bag back on\NBrownie's tail or we'll leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just in time, look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in his monster form fighting the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even guess what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All done, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you're perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back to the biscuit room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that boy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here anymore. Huh? The boy? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him go into the secret room\Nwhere we're not supposed to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And then something weird happened\Nand he turned into a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, you know?
